Hi! I add the parameter which customize password rest confirm URL.
I set the parameter in customized PasswordResetSerializer.

``` python
class CustomPasswordResetSerializer(PasswordResetSerializer):
    def get_email_options(self):
        def url_generator(request, user_pk, temp_key):
            return f'https://example.com/{user_pk}/{temp_key}'

        return {
            'url_generator': url_generator
        }
```

Closes #248,#359 

